# Squash solo - Phase 1 A: Drive & Move
@description Solo practice for one court, about 50 minutes: straight drives, feeding and stepping
  in, drives from the front court and short sequences, between rounds of ghosting to the corners.
  Each drill has a target; hit every target in two sessions back to back to move up.
@speech rate 1.1
@minimum gap 0:00.8
@workout squash
@artwork ../images/squash.jpg
@include ../shared/squash.overtone

## Intro
Phase one, session A: drive and move. Drills with a phase two target say so. Hit every target in two
sessions back to back to move up.

## Movement warm-up (4 min)
[movement warm-up]

## Figure of eight warm-up (3 min)
[figure of eight]

## Forehand straight drives (3 min)
Forehand straight drives, three minutes. A racket length off the side wall, at the back of the
service box. Medium pace, just above the service line, with the first bounce in the service box, so
it comes up to you. This one is control, so stay behind the ball, no T.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Racket up as the ball leaves the front wall.
1:15 Finish high, pointing at the front wall.
1:45 Lost the rhythm? Higher and softer to reset.
2:10 Grip. Prep. Rotate. Swish. Follow.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand straight drives (3 min)
Backhand straight drives, three minutes. A racket length off the side wall, at the back of the
service box. Medium pace, just above the service line, with the first bounce in the service box, so
it comes up to you. This one is control, so stay behind the ball, no T.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Racket up early. No wrist twist.
1:15 Use the space. Don't crowd the ball.
1:45 Lost the rhythm? Higher and softer to reset.
2:10 Grip. Prep. Rotate. Swish. Follow.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: back corners (3 min)
Ghosting, back corners, three minutes. Slow pace. Go via the corner of the service box, swing on the
beep, and get back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [slow back]
0:50 Rest. Plant at forty-five degrees. Full swish.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:05 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [slow back]
1:54 Rest. Fast back to the T. Split step.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:09 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [slow back]
---
[stop]

## Forehand feed and step in (3 min)
Forehand feed and step in, three minutes. From behind the short line, tap a soft, high feed so it
lands near the short line. Get behind it, feet facing the side wall, stomp your front foot, and
drive deep: a racket head above the service line, first bounce behind the service box. Score each
set of ten. Phase two target: seven out of ten with the second bounce at the back wall, misses in
between allowed.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Get behind the ball.
1:15 Stomp, and let your weight go forward.
2:10 Target: seven out of ten to the back wall.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand feed and step in (3 min)
Backhand feed and step in, three minutes. From behind the short line, tap a soft, high feed so it
lands near the short line. Get behind it, feet facing the side wall, stomp your front foot, and
drive deep: a racket head above the service line, first bounce behind the service box. Score each
set of ten. Phase two target: seven out of ten with the second bounce at the back wall, misses in
between allowed.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Get behind the ball.
1:15 Racket away from your body. Rotate.
2:10 Target: seven out of ten to the back wall.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Forehand front-court drives (2 min)
Forehand front-court drives, two minutes. A step in front of the short line, a racket length off the
side wall. Straight drives to length, a racket head above the service line with the first bounce
behind the service box, turning your shoulders more than feels natural.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Go around the ball, not at it.
1:10 Rotate. Finish high, to the front wall.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand front-court drives (2 min)
Backhand front-court drives, two minutes. A step in front of the short line, a racket length off the
side wall. Straight drives to length, a racket head above the service line with the first bounce
behind the service box, turning your shoulders more than feels natural.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Go around the ball, not at it.
1:10 Racket away from your body. Use the space.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: front corners (3 min)
Ghosting, front corners, three minutes. Medium pace. Lunge closed, left foot forward on the right
and right foot forward on the left. Swing on the beep, and get back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
0:47 Rest. Racket up before you leave the T.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:02 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
1:48 Rest. Push back hard from the lunge.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:03 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium front]
---
[stop]

## Forehand drive and recover (2 min)
Forehand drive and recover, two minutes. Behind the short line, higher, softer straight drives to
buy time: a racket length above the service line, first bounce at the back of the service box. After
each one, push two steps toward the T and back in behind the ball. The recovery is the drill.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Shot. Two steps. Back in.
1:10 Rushed? Hit higher and softer.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand drive and recover (2 min)
Backhand drive and recover, two minutes. Behind the short line, higher, softer straight drives to
buy time: a racket length above the service line, first bounce at the back of the service box. After
each one, push two steps toward the T and back in behind the ball. The recovery is the drill.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Shot. Two steps. Back in.
1:10 Rushed? Hit higher and softer.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: middle and back (3 min)
Ghosting, middle and back, three minutes. Medium pace. Back corners via the box corner, middle open
or closed. Swing on the beep, and get back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, no repeats} [medium middle], [medium back]
0:47 Rest. Plant at forty-five degrees at the back.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:02 @random{fill, no repeats} [medium middle], [medium back]
1:48 Rest. Split step on every call.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:03 @random{fill, no repeats} [medium middle], [medium back]
---
[stop]

## Forehand three-shot sequence (2 min)
Forehand three-shot sequence, two minutes. Straight drives in turn. Soft, on the service line,
bouncing in the service box. Medium, a racket head above it, bouncing behind the box. Then hard,
just under the service line, so it comes off the back wall.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Soft. Medium. Hard.
1:10 Same preparation every time. Only the swing speed changes.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand three-shot sequence (2 min)
Backhand three-shot sequence, two minutes. Straight drives in turn. Soft, on the service line,
bouncing in the service box. Medium, a racket head above it, bouncing behind the box. Then hard,
just under the service line, so it comes off the back wall.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:20 Soft. Medium. Hard.
1:10 Same preparation every time. Only the swing speed changes.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: six points (3 min)
Ghosting, six points, three minutes. Fast pace, all six positions. Phase two target: every rep at
the beep with a full swish, and form that holds to the last round. Split step on every call, swing
on the beep, and sprint back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
0:33 Rest. Stay engaged. Low and wide at the T.
-0:03 [countdown]
0:48 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
1:20 Rest. Feet pointing forward. Knees bent.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:35 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
2:07 Rest. Last round. Stay engaged.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:22 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
---
[stop]

## Cool-down (3 min)
[cool-down]

## Finish
+0:01.5 That's session A. Well done.
